<span style=3D"font-size:11pt;">I thought RSAM did 2.56s averages (8 bits a=
t 100 Hz), but heck, you wrote it, so I guess it is 5.12s.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824MsoNormal">
<span style=3D"font-size:11pt;">I think at Montserrat we also had RSAM TRIG=
 files (as well as EVNT files).</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
