<span style=3D"font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824MsoNormal">
<span style=3D"font-size:11pt;">To me, the most fascinating parts of the RS=
AM system were the real-time bargraphs (2.56s, 60s,</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
