<span style=3D"color:black;">Hi Tom,</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">Thanks so much=E2=80=94this is really encourag=
ing news. I'm grateful that you=E2=80=99re willing to check your archives t=
his weekend. If any of the RSAM, tilt, or SSAM data turns up, it=E2=80=99ll=
 be a big step forward in helping us remaster the Pinatubo
 dataset for long-term preservation and reuse.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">As part of a broader effort, I=E2=80=99m also =
setting up a legacy PC with support for older software and for reading olde=
r media=E2=80=94Zip drives, DDS DAT tapes, and even 5.25&quot; and 3.5&quot=
; floppies=E2=80=94so we can access and convert whatever formats may
 be out there.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">Regarding the instrument response: no worries =
if details on the gains are lost. We can always estimate average combined g=
ains and site effects statistically by comparing network-wide amplitudes fo=
r a suite of well-located events.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">Would you be interested in co-authoring the da=
ta paper with John Power and me? We'd be happy to have your input and histo=
rical insights. Either way, we=E2=80=99ll be sure to acknowledge your contr=
ibution to the dataset and this recovery effort.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">And yes, I completely hear you on the politica=
l situation. The impacts on science, jobs, our allies, and the economy are =
weakening the USA. It is particularly sad to see the attacks on USAID. At t=
he university, we=E2=80=99re bracing for major
 funding cuts across the board=E2=80=94grim stuff. Wishing you and your par=
t of the world continued stability.</span></p>
<p class=3D"ydp6a1bf750yiv0940122886ydp1446a2c4yiv0638533206ydpa046c48fyiv3=
947432043ydpc1c4cb3cyiv5911277824ydpd5b01fd3yiv5969160131xydpb5bb7620yiv996=
0329489ydp2a0b618byiv8513831340msonormal">
<span style=3D"color:black;">Wishing you a good weekend,<br clear=3D"none">
